Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnArial Black\fs18\b1\c&H000000&\3c&HFFFFFF&\bord1\shad1\pos(192,200)}『Interview Practice』
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.00,0:00:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Nia talked to me and I calmed down, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.50,0:00:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,it looks like the camera crew is still pretty nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.30,0:00:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It's our first time filming, \Nso it can't be helped.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.90,0:00:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I know! Before we go interview the contestants, \Nwhy don't we do a practice run here?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.40,0:00:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a great idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.50,0:00:26.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, just like the real deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.94,0:00:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hilde-sama will be the interviewer and \NNia will play the contestant.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.00,0:00:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds good!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.30,0:00:34.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then, everyone on the camera crew, \Nwe're counting on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.40,0:00:37.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah, we are counting on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.90,0:00:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright then... \NReady... Action!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.90,0:00:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.10,0:00:45.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Nia Liston.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.15,0:00:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Your specialty?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.25,0:00:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Eye-pokes and low blows.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.00,0:00:49.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, isn't that against the rules?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.80,0:00:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Give us your enthusiasm for the tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.90,0:00:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I plan to offer up everyone as a blood sacrifice. \NI'll do my best!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.80,0:00:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,CUT!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.10,0:01:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on Nia! \NNo student would ever say something like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.50,0:01:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It was obviously a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.60,0:01:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,When you say it, \Nit doesn't sound like a joke at all, though!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.40,0:01:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I was just trying to ease the camera crew's tension.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.20,0:01:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel like that only made them \Neven more nervous, though...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.00,0:01:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.66,0:01:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's just take it easy for \Nthe real recording too!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.00,0:01:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.60,0:01:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an5\fnImpact\fs42\b1\c&H000000&\3c&HFFFFFF&\bord4\shad2\t(0,50,\fscx108\fscy92\frz-2)\t(50,100,\fscx95\fscy105\frz2)\t(1000,1500,\fscx105\fscy95\frz-1)\t(1500,2000,\fscx98\fscy102\frz1)\pos(187.733,20.622)}ゴゴゴゴゴ…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.80,0:01:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,As if we can!
